      "justification": "Exact match for the review action on the rejection path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if the claim is accepted, prepare the claim discharge."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly restates the preparation step following the accepted path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the claim discharge is prepared, record the benefit payment."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully reproduces the recording step and its temporal trigger."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the claim rejection is accepted, continue the process. But if the claim rejection is not accepted, also continue the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the unified continuation outcome described across both conditional branches."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, the process ends."
